# Task 147-003 Execution Plan — Authority Matrix

## Objective
Implement authority-matrix.ts with 4 presets (strict/balanced/autopilot/full-auto), safety floor enforcement, and resolvePolicy() function. Write 12 comprehensive tests.

## Dependencies
- src/core/nervous-types.ts (EXISTS — all types ready)
- src/nervous/action-registry.ts (Task 2, may not exist yet — will import but tests mock it)

## Implementation Steps

### Step 1: Create src/nervous/authority-matrix.ts (~200 LoC)
- Import types from nervous-types.ts
- Import ACTION_BY_ID from action-registry.ts
- Define SAFETY_FLOOR constant (5 locked actions)
- Define 4 matrix presets (STRICT, BALANCED, AUTOPILOT, FULL_AUTO)
- Define MATRIX_BY_MODE Map
- Implement resolvePolicy() with 4-layer resolution:
  1. Safety floor check (always approve)
  2. User override check
  3. Matrix action override check
  4. Default risk→policy mapping
- Export getMatrixByMode() helper

### Step 2: Create tests/nervous/authority-matrix.test.ts (12 tests)
- Mock action-registry.ts to provide test ActionDefinitions
- Test all 4 presets with correct risk→policy mappings
- Test safety floor VETO in all modes including full-auto
- Test user override application
- Test safety floor override immunity
- Test error handling (unknown action)
- Test reason strings from all 4 resolution paths
- Test MATRIX_BY_MODE size and safety floor identity
- Test readonly immutability

### Step 3: Verify
- tsc --noEmit
- npx vitest run tests/nervous/authority-matrix.test.ts

## Files Modified
- src/nervous/authority-matrix.ts (NEW)
- tests/nervous/authority-matrix.test.ts (NEW)

